{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1224,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5605e3a85d9521b4d68ab79e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这么晚，辛苦你了。\r\n训练员也是很努力的人呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b03dd1920ecd9b187654fb4093757a22f45b33e1a492cfc6fb6aaf27f0b0faf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:792c57b677d72dd533142a02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天暖洋洋的，很舒服。\r\n我有时候会因为午睡跟散步\r\n而忘记要回去上课呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed466a307b248a3f5295b82ee839ce0420903a60be4f2dcdb2f38d826a481291",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a504e5e1c9f51611baf67e44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奔跑的时候虽然很凉快，\r\n但只要一停下来就会觉得很热……\r\n要怎么样才能一直不停地奔跑呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e22a346ff1b15e3ec62d3ec3ebd50a1c2d45602a96aa80847410071d878226c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:963a8ae34e1040613cd9c52d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "进入了舒服的季节了呢。\r\n肚子也变得更容易饿了……\r\n今天吃什么好……",
      "source_fingerprint": "267e7fa7486221affdf4a1ea064d567c423cac6ccdf131b1e8f6cec68c3edb79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cc17616517ab97d0fbb79e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近好像在流行感冒。\r\n感冒真的很不好，人会变怪怪的……\r\n我们都要小心才好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "844c3cef568502e6ff6ed4b8fca53f641e9d265028112cfbbb7742ea18f4d6bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cbc40f198c250d3db5a6f3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服很棒喔。\r\n内侧写着为我加油的话……\r\n每天早上看到都会涌现力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee743d5c09d28321068bec539dfa488afc9bc6fa6f5c0f8051aa9fdb328508f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1805106d783c81fda833393",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安，你检查过枕边了吗？\r\n说不定有冒失的圣诞老人\r\n来过了喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c61e11f180f7ad9aa8a5b542f8fb93f281aac40d1c636a836c720c762b220d0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d49b329902153b15591a6111",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟你说。我在餐厅说想吃\r\n大只的鸡，小鹰一听到就跑掉了……\r\n究竟是怎么回事呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8506f9f7eae8997390403652e7aebcce5510b2cd6ed59c645ddd0a67fb5e5f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6550e033d40425a315f7d7bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像这样发呆晒太阳，\r\n就舒服得像是要融化一样……\r\n这就是雪人的心情吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a1c412ec0a9ee482f341ffe388da8bd0126d396263fe663ace5baf96e865425",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:374031e022459d698c2fffea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别太勉强自己。\r\n要是一直不睡会被当作坏孩子，\r\n可能就收不到礼物咯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a7ee6db924aba7f71a9c2f4072249ad57aadb563cd5f3bc26a124cbe3949bb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f303978e3c78d20286d7fec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好想在夜空中奔驰看看啊……\r\n不管什么时候……什么地方……\r\n都能一直奔驰下去吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a87e20794de6ef04928a1538f0d0e8cc4bc5d4bb76a93673b1fb9d9a94c2585a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6381f4ca242e7fb92bbe298b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔，以为是冷杉才爬上去，\r\n结果是柳杉……有花粉症的话，\r\n现在最好不要靠近我……",
      "source_fingerprint": "20d59c7e49d5aa97e43ded91d204d3d9413115049f63f91a103be862aef92b7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1477950077571225173e143f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，圣诞老人\r\n在夏天好像会冲浪。\r\n我也开始跟晨光一起练习好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1f4fdd9cb4e01327c219a1fed9d665329dd390a964a8dd4a7b9292fa853b1c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3bce703dce9922282dc01c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道吗？球果可以吃。\r\n换句话说……花圈可以当作\r\n紧急状态时的食物喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3a74153947c9c5a3b62b30b6ebab84e941c7a005f5fb56f8c3a803f2a92b238",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e9cace22eeffb8d25adc69e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，你有溜冰的经验吗？\r\n没有的话，我可以教你喔。\r\n这有点算是我的强项。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8badb6443eef7494b2005b4ee299d1608c0472c53b48bf0197cf8d4d6ab3b0b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ace9ee87c266e033390e06b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c118c10441ebb2d8ca294f4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:406e67d66965eb6fa20431ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好。……接下来，要不要\n一起吃早饭？我还没吃\n呢。第3顿，早饭。",
      "source_fingerprint": "122992e3bb9714dfc5ab2e51b8bc3db95538abba465651d9ddecc08cd1fde6ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51de2235bb6680e5f14d1ccf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晨练之后好好地淋浴了\n哦。我也有在注意时尚\n呢。呵呵……味道很好闻吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bfa4ce64fb7ec55955705691fa85fe4af91cf41640dffb81cf55f13667d777b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38647af517302e8c85812b1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小玉说，穿那件衣服就不要吃\n带酱汁的东西……我的话一口\n就能吃掉。明明能吃得很干净的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "713d1c3362def31e465ffc72646fe91859ac3307df0c42c39e7135b1c5e0d6c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d01cc3c29fd4796a0577b99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自助餐厅的人们，真厉害。\n即使我来了，也微笑着迎接我。\n……就像是在挑战一样的笑容……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d83b4d11eb283aeddfedbb18395fbb72b5b1a3d0577c107765f1d6ad9732f952",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:517fdfa41b14086f699ee48a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快乐的一天。要在十二点\n结束真是可惜……\n不过，也很期待明天的开始呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "355adcc0469017c83d23294a1a17690c31b3a3e01577e252189c23da7eecd99d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ac459ceb0270ce49e9ab896",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "灰姑娘，在十二点的钟声敲响\n之前都在忘我地跳舞……真厉害啊。\n那是何等的，体力啊……呼啊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "750437fef0215b8163afbfc030b70452d8dfcfdeeb2622600cfaa7f4b31020cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ea56e1a43a1551a77e34b1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道笠松春祭吗？\n樱花很漂亮，路边摊和餐车\n也会来。会来，很多哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc4bf22c252bebe5373df06f1e56987868c9e8000d36e84d5564aff59e765b6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ce428acac5c54c2c9f8ae93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "笠松音头，特雷森音头……\n夏天就是盂兰盆舞啊。你想先学会\n跳哪一个？我可以教你哦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7aa99aa03d971ab688a6465a7952412099633d3d445b3d72c0123a2caa38089e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:757ec148afad18b08316e83c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃得好跑得快，出色的赛马娘\n……要以此为目标的话，是个好季节。\n在这个秋天一口气接近目标给你看……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8101ffc78018bc8fb90ccfb20eaa9170a4d71e49e29d2d00c5e5d23910a6d10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d029a526009e03997493f62c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在笠松为我应援的人，\n寄来了手编的毛衣。\n……其实每年，都会寄来。呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2319614daf53073983b4925ebc14f2fc7e11b65ab502a2ee0547019c30c782b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9804944db0e12d28cc6bdbd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ac9ec33e532e7cb95f67826",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和小玉起了争执……\r\n但你听我说，说到烤鱿鱼\r\n一般都是整只烤吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ece18af0c390f41d0894b1e4f98b429796795942b15a78d76fb26aee40186ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:673eafed9ff502bace5a926d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯……刚刚在走廊上\r\n被溪流摸了头……\r\n是我头发乱翘了吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "46d99644a43dce0c0205cdc70eb5dd32bc4309c00e05902fee84f6bf1f0a9632",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6db15ee6fa46ba9d72ac56b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家乡的人寄了信来给我。\r\n我该怎么回信好……\r\n想写的事情太多了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "921e6a00a990231262a3dcc0771d4f58090c43f96e74caeb442fd9e0a59e18a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4906ee0f55daf1aaf6236854",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我很喜欢食堂，\r\n但总是感觉很多人在看我……\r\n是还没完全融入大家的关系吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "182539a5ad9f259058e5dcc8d94d1cdc8779d4b951b63dd27e2ecbb6f0146534",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55ca2b916a50feae05c90fb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很佩服大家手机可以操作得\r\n这么熟练。突然震动的时候，\r\n大家都不会吓到吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7101cd3386943334a4d2d1b86168301fcf8e4180a1a754cbc9f08b91d3964301",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9a119a660a69025de3fccc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，帮我拍张照吧。\r\n我想让家人看我现在的样子，\r\n但我不知道怎么用拍照功能……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad460367ee34ca64af70ed5552e22feb3de8b16e5e309987f535429dbd423b60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75ad1b8a74576426557a67b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想让家乡的人看到我的成长，\r\n让他们开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2cbe91f4ace869a0650e146708db1d543adbee4639b7cace02d7df37a24fb53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c22cbc8ab484757cb785de7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服就是我的标志，\r\n可以让人远远就一眼认出我。\r\n所以我要表现得更好才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46b97e52ed43a937adb6a8f7a0a0126c5c14387343ced12120a0e1284656a45f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb8dc0cdfa0d81896f8e371b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服……可以很灵活地活动。\r\n就像是在叫我「跑起来」的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e0a354c37ad985e18a8ee3842662077768f51b17e3bcc0ab9afa57432b7aa20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aff65c27bd8da6614138fad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……很舒服。\r\n我还是最喜欢早晨了，\r\n会有种很清爽的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2f8c96d3b66f931ec8407d6e9e1fdda7dae79be863f2eed73932777c139d05d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7bd195542af24b73c94bdd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和稻荷去吃了午餐，\r\n她吃饭的速度超快的。\r\n那种吃法应该对身体很不好吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ead7758611387d940da6952566db36491673861d03a4356069c8e955a3c6871c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:975d005b83a079a3d8acfeb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会手下留情的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3696c23e018426f02e5f648050e1bb54acd28309e9feaab4718dfc04abb7c036",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30b081aff5bec5b1f74fccc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽全力活动、尽全力大吃。\r\n再来就是要尽全力睡得饱饱的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "674dca5942df99e58fd2893455626545c415d9faa92d6c13e7c4e94deaaaa1bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca329f60ac42ec9b174c1d06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好想要去赏花啊。\r\n和大家一起吃饭一定会很好吃。\r\n你说我醉翁之意不在酒？什么意思啊……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4e307d7a4f7ecc74e14a97616040a27b00c10e5f9eef619ec9d96afd6f97775",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:804b1fae5c8b9f2486483f28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小玉她教我用果汁\r\n做棒冰的方法了。\r\n那真的很惊人……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d9c4122318f41bdaade6e26b5ac119a229a53bc341017aff245169a5e754a36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e17eb67a3373f504302fd183",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到秋天就会想到秋刀鱼、烤地瓜、\r\n柿子……真是美妙的季节……！\r\n我最喜欢了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b01296f3df2f3e753bf19e6a8e629f2dd3f23ced6b13a958a2aeed45b796b7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a991f28217f85f8e833cd6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始变冷了呢……\r\n也就代表是开始要吃锅的季节了。\r\n在暖桌上吃火锅……嗯，真好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b4bc08ecedc5f02877b8b4b9c9a36918c2a0f900d1dc3fd66dbf1cbe6163ca6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9499afa9413e3efd5da8d9d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小玉家好像会在圣诞节\r\n举办章鱼烧派对。\r\n……下次圣诞节就在小玉房间集合。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d6bfec5bcf5ef163d9a3d3418da0c07a948c4658d8072aedc1e18509539bc3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2785088dd1ef93faa9d9bc68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿红衣服的晨光\r\n真的好像圣诞老人啊。\r\n从背面看起来的话……还特别像。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d34a1ae4b7a819f425b42659bd98728269dfafcfc2a8e8e84909f0ca05f93e8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e258d4b329d1b3c12520eab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真想跟圣诞老人的驯鹿\r\n赛跑一次看看啊……\r\n一定很快吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1aba32db3ce52c58536ee4f1bde7ba1a22308d385d9d1d911c70d6742a36b4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ec72bfd3d466d926738402a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服该怎么洗……\r\n溪流正为了这件事烦恼。\r\n我能不能帮上她的忙呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e187762a0767f982432dcc425ab1f3b60fcc53722e70734599f4c6d107f231f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79d3856ea6dcf14be354eb3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蜡烛好像有助眠效果。\r\n……不过要小心，要是太靠近，\r\n会变成红鼻子驯鹿喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "371d19027b622aeb996102715adaf076edd2009982faa00fa86fa700b7cde47f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95d174e8c370acde37281542",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是能像圣诞老人那样飞在天上，\r\n上学就会更轻松了……啊！\r\n可是没有烟囱就进不了学校吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "beaff9792dd030095c37b0a320f3efbe1c1a2e5615b3ffb32422b5a6bcb59026",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48644b5edd03b4564bc173fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这腰带好厉害啊。就算因为吃太多\r\n而撑大肚子，也会跟着变松……\r\n有了这个，午餐也能大吃特吃了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61bc243aadd86b180a7f0801181aadb0d2d8a328b615beea065f0da31820f875",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bf498176edc00750b5e9d46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我总是在睡前把这套服装\r\n折得整整齐齐的，放在枕头旁边。\r\n希望有一天能让圣诞老人看到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6280cedf8dc5eabc9afcb2a948d387e48144fa536e44610a366762d2f0dde2f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f43e7000df802d5d8fa3db1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也好想让圣诞老人看到\r\n盛开的樱花啊……一定能帮他\r\n消除圣诞节的疲惫。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02bd0f520265eca38cfde827a324b0c5508fcb28ae12779668e9a693fbd5a438",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dd39d1139faf7821b301c65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊！如果在冬天做出一个\r\n巨大无比的雪人……\r\n夏天不就也能玩雪了吗……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d78fcc38e850cc0bb17750515eb4e53bdc29c7d00d7b54cd6f40cd765640700a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c832abc6c1032aa7a6d617e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多该写信给圣诞老人了。\r\n……不嫌弃的话要不要跟我一起写？\r\n我在故乡时都是跟母亲一起写的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f96c27260200561704276502393f5488dfb0c82576d415fa72be5f94f3322924",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ce37be038728934c547dd8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节能清楚看见星星……\r\n只要看过一次就深深烙印在心中……\r\n我也想……发出那样的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6071c845408ffb8d1dc33e363b70340321e4ddc4414126ad16e398120e7d07b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d593a1349fd16e6caea4d7c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "星星装饰……很棒对吧。\r\n看着就会让人产生勇气，觉得\r\n自己的表现不能输给它的光芒……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98152d93472ee0e57f523e08986783453b81e0b0706f5a8846b28cca4d2e5986",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f588444cd9d6c11960e428a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小玉好像非常喜欢我头上的铃铛。\r\n多亏了铃铛的声响，\r\n我应该不会再跟她走散了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cebba58802b21da5a80097bf3c627b3d49e07f92f587b5b1190ef49d800d4645",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e008ff109884824867096550",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "八重教过我。\n只要腹部用力的话，稍微\n一点空腹感是能忍耐的。……哦嘶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1462b1014e391bef700333299c46509f704f2bb53c6ef1dc8c214a576678c96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:631b787b10930c8f6d0d37de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巧克力，胡萝卜，苹果……好厉害\n用赖恩推荐的蛋白粉可以做甜点自助餐了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75f773e3ba2bce293bad825169fec1a5b9fb4034f8436201c80bfbe0855816cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ad038a63d3451ecb58e23f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿尔丹，注视着这双鞋子说了。\n这是不会解开，不会破碎的，\n魔法的玻璃鞋……微笑着说的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc026d9b080790b2ce8be49bb27ed94ba90db3292a521a5994ffa2f714894408",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c64726f00879af4ad502b7b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使是比赛前，和小玉也从未\n闹过别扭。……像往常一样，\n互道晚安，和早上好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5390acae17c65beb054a836116e8901f88aa6ca5aecb8a2428b49717d829c594",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:770212fb2a306d651d8cd308",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有人看了我的奔跑，低语说是\n『神』。……在我看来，低语的那个人的\n眼瞳，看起来更加尊贵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3733b6e3079db2d8097cdfc02002a12ca10e7c756b9554b8d07a4daa5bf4a63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba47b98016ea10e5b88099a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早饭后刚想去跑步，\n就被小海湾擦了嘴巴。\n……说是，变成了牛奶胡子……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "999c58d0e63c2a0c8c0cb74d884409cc7efee118ece0033a7595647c7b3c76e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b443e158e2989be6b01e10a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稻荷的声音很大啊。\n即使在拥挤的自助餐厅，\n邀请入座的声音也能马上传达过来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b2433e1bea0e2ab7e581a548eeaaf3ab44b9a3de4a29018b41692045818ee3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a65d2130bf58ec1fc9aabe5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "千代王好像会在日记里，写下学到的东西\n和格言。真了不起啊……我只要写下当天的\n饮食就满足了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca717f974c37e3aa8239a11ca4121411efae7d2a774370e922f3f34ea066afdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9889bd9c1261c1e973fa63ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被新生们请求合影了。\n……很多是，跳舞的姿势。\n嗯。因为这套衣服，很帅气啊",
      "source_fingerprint": "e100995db39af4cbf0797b77a12c12a68492a821be3285fe9d3ee8dd868847c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79a07ccb4e9daada3a960fbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把头发绑成一束后，脖子上的热感……\n稍微好一点了。不对，不起作用啊。\n抱歉，我先要被热化掉了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab555f91a12b8e7e75d842279556bf6f6765873308b8b9a9b13f081939c963df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ba3d5080dac4f826cb41f2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为很帅气，所以穿着那套衣服\n不要吃到肚子鼓起来，\n大家……要把肚子凹进去吗？呼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d511ab8b7d52dbdd37ff065b942f34e4c33a04e1130b28de256c4c8c1b75f62d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2141ecbe4264f8e4804ea62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使混在雪中，即使混在人群中。\n如果是训练员的话，会找到我\n吗？……会找到的吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "3155759a7841a8f157974f34e4bf029358394659d4daa81af8970e7f282197cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26c07b0060d129cc16c229ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被说像王子殿下一样。\n……该怎么回答才好呢？\n邀请跳舞？笠松音头……吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7d2b4ab7b7bceaab3c4a70d484f81a839af6574c9e76eff4124e3505c15fb5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e302b9fae7d658758c2a6a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心中的一番星，一直在这里。\n为了闪烁，在这里，火热地……\n持续跳动着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe3ab240d363f01c13903dca0d9412f9e4c9108c7e65b5bbf42214b505c5c933",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55a808c73adf880c07e8e6d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们要开始训练了吧。\r\n今天要做什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee053fe50eab32bfb761c73fc5c452c5159b46d7fb6f2a33aa6d9d65733dc252",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:424f9ce5913845e0c2807388",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "602dd5bd12b0d5089900226573bb73477f4d5e5b12e24ab6c953ba984b68eee9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:875fd11b39b5c3753355648c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是什么样的训练\r\n我都会完成的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b10670e33e57e4424c8964ed8f4ca93a228729713c9f1beb5a804afbec99c9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e997b8ee095e007445d75476",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经做完伸展运动，\r\n训练的事前准备也都做好了。\r\n随时可以开始哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d66ac48567d64c0ca5ac628fc8495391e5f5f5b90c0e861b0a55cab0001daf0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8bd54d2e5654fe3e266e26f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能跑得更快，\r\n每天不断累积训练是很重要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ed3784148689eb4f5c50b76cfaff349be7aaf2e8c6ddce993fc50d58f8b57ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:373af624463c241bc1bc680e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想要有配得上这套衣服的表现。\r\n今天的训练也麻烦你了，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a635e1be3f0079b9aae6c1a5c5746ba796abb86101136d1adfbbf383a385165a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fadf48cad10b19b352c65f8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了让家乡的人高兴，\r\n我今后……也要继续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "128004a74c9b70e51b165c86e55c9b58d0223df56b2f5c63a595630fad410aba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92006"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
